\pard\s2\outlinelevel1\keepn\sb160\sa80\ql\plain\b\fs24 3.2 The Markov Decision Process\par
\pard\plain\qj\sl276\slmult1\sa80\fs24 The controller sees 16 numbers (Table 3.1). Six actions exist: INVOKE_RESEARCHER, INVOKE_SOLVER (only before a first answer), INVOKE_VERIFIER, INVOKE_SUMMARIZER and RETRY_SOLVER (each needing an answer), and STOP. Illegal actions are masked in both action selection and the learning update.\par
