\pard\s1\outlinelevel0\keepn\sb220\sa80\ql\plain\b\fs28 APPENDIX A: CODE ORGANISATION AND REPRODUCTION\par
\pard\plain\qj\sl276\slmult1\sa80\fs24 The repository has six code packages: {\b env} (simulator and Gym-style environment), {\b baselines} (single agent, fixed pipeline, rules), {\b rl} (Double DQN, replay buffer, training), {\b eval} (evaluation runner and the tuning, shift, ablation, blind and real-trace studies), {\b llm} (model client, agents, 50 tasks with graders, trace cache and replay environment) and {\b app} (race engine, charts, Streamlit dashboard). Run {\b PYTHONPATH=. python3 -m pytest -q tests} for the tests, {\b python3 -m eval.tune_dqn}, {\b eval.shift}, {\b eval.ablate}, {\b eval.ablate_blind}, {\b eval.real_eval <cache>} and {\b eval.real_eval_typed <cache>} for the studies, and {\b ./run_demo.sh} for the dashboard. All run logs are in {\b docs/logs}.\par
